      "totalDuration": "8 yrs",
      "description": "Lead efforts to optimize workflows and improve the user experience in Alma and Primo, our library services and discovery platforms. Develop solutions in Python using Alma’s API’s to perform data extraction and cleanup in bulk. Produce complex reports in Alma Analytics (Oracle OBIEE), writing custom SQL where necessary, to provide actionable data to stakeholders. Manage and troubleshoot configurations and integrations from a holistic perspective, leading and contributing to cross-functional teams both within the organization and across a consortium of academic libraries, in support of continuous improvement in acquisition, curation, access, and discovery. Monitor and test monthly product releases, and contribute to consortial planning and execution for a major system re-architecture. Write and deploy Angular.js customizations to improve the user experience in Primo. Work with the vendor (Ex Libris) to achieve prompt resolution to bugs and regressions, and advocate for enhancements that support our library’s mission and strategic goals. Lead and support other software projects, including web development and open-source application development (Social Feed Manager). Support data analysis and visualization across the organization. Contribute to computational literacy and information literacy by teaching workshops and providing consultations on writing code and conducting research.",
      "insights": ""
     },
