      "description": "Provided leadership for the Libraries' collection strategy and stewardship of the collections budget. Gathered, analyzed, and presented data related to collections for use in decision-making. Led a collaborative process to identify cross-disciplinary priorities for new acquisitions. Set spending targets and tracked progress. Worked with vendors to negotiate on price and services. Developed strategies for outreach to faculty, students, and university administrators. Served as liaison to the English, Classics, Philosophy, and Religion Departments.",
